{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"7a71c1757ffd1afec829c2e11c9e9b9c42d2262a479a215701e5cb67a85f1043","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["预言有人离弃真道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["圣灵明说，在后来的时候，必有人离弃真道，听从那引诱人的邪灵和鬼魔的道理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这是因为说谎之人的假冒；这等人的良心如同被热铁烙惯了一般。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们禁止嫁娶，又禁戒食物",{"noteId":4},"，就是 神所造、叫那信而明白真道的人感谢着领受的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["凡 神所造的物都是好的，若感谢着领受，就没有一样可弃的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["都因 神的道和人的祈求成为圣洁了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["基督耶稣的好执事"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你若将这些事提醒弟兄们，便是基督耶稣的好执事，在真道的话语和你向来所服从的善道上得了教育。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["只是要弃绝那世俗的言语和老妇荒谬的话，在敬虔上操练自己。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["「操练身体，益处还少；惟独敬虔，凡事都有益处，因有今生和来生的应许。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这话是可信的，是十分可佩服的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们劳苦努力，正是为此，因我们的指望在乎永生的 神；他是万人的救主，更是信徒的救主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["这些事，你要吩咐人，也要教导人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["不可叫人小看你年轻，总要在言语、行为、爱心、信心、清洁上，都作信徒的榜样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要以宣读、劝勉、教导为念，直等到我来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你不要轻忽所得的恩赐，就是从前借着预言、在众长老按手的时候赐给你的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["这些事你要殷勤去做，并要在此专心，使众人看出你的长进来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你要谨慎自己和自己的教训，要在这些事上恒心；因为这样行，又能救自己，又能救听你的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或译：又叫人戒荤","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}